#==============================================================================================
#
#   html_option_element - HTML::HTMLOptionElement: <option>
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/HTML/HTMLOptionElement.cpp (lines 1-371) and the inline functions of
#       HTMLOptionElement.h: construction (which moves the mixin tables to HTMLOptionElement's,
#       as C++'s vptrs move), selectedness and dirtiness, the value, text and label, the index
#       in the list of options, disabled options, the form, the cached nearest ancestor select
#       element, cloning into a selectedcontent element, and the insertion, removing, moving
#       and children changed steps.
